  "limitations": [
    "The templates support sample-aware LIANA 1.7, CellPhoneDB 5, CellChat 2.2, and NicheNet 2.2 analysis with explicit versioned resources. The public GSE96583 case validates the LIANA CellPhoneDB method with true permutation p values and independent-sample replication; the other three backends retain executable fixture evidence rather than public biological acceptance evidence. The workflows do not infer physical contact or causal signaling, do not use cells as independent replicates, and do not permit a condition-level claim from one sample per condition. Direct CellPhoneDB is restricted to human symbols in the validated template; NicheNet requires external project-pinned network matrices and donor-aware receiver DE rather than a cell-level contrast."
  ],
